      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "The \"Grizzly Giant\" is one of the main attractions in <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Mariposa_Grove\" title=\"Mariposa Grove\">Mariposa Grove</a> in <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Yosemite_National_Park\" title=\"Yosemite National Park\">Yosemite National Park</a>. It is a landmark ancient <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Sequoiadendron_giganteum\" title=\"Sequoiadendron giganteum\">Giant redwood</a> (<i>Sequoiadendron giganteum</i>) tree. Note the size of the people at the bottom of the image for scale.",
